cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If Lilly or its measurements help your work, please cite the software and the accompanying white paper."
type: software
title: "Lilly: An Offline Bosnian-English Translator"
abstract: >-
  An offline Bosnian-English translator that accepts text, speech, and
  photographs, then returns translation and speech through one local FastAPI
  service. The repository publishes the serving path, held-out measurements,
  data artifacts, and negative results.
authors:
